&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, train and develop an accomplished team of net-new Mid-Market Account Executives focused on hunting and closing new logos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and coach the sourcing, sales, product, and industry skills each rep needs to win competitive net-new deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and refine a clean, repeatable handoff process with the to ensure a seamless customer experience post-close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivate team members and drive high performance through your leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly report on team and individual results, with a focus on new-logo volume, new ACV, and pipeline generation/coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and make recommendations for improvement in prospecting process, deal velocity, win rate, and overall team efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Marketing, SDR, and Sales Engineering leadership to ensure the team has the pipeline and technical support needed to hit net-new targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
