&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, both verbal and written, with the ability to articulate technical ideas clearly and collaborate effectively within a team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
