&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*We operate in a flexible hybrid work model. You must be eligible to work in Ireland.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What makes Engineering at Gong unique?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Gong, we trust and empower our employees with ownership to solve complex problems, make the right decisions, and build the best products that create radical impact. We call this “Own. Solve. Impact.”&amp;nbsp; For our engineers, it means it&#39;s not just about writing code. You are involved and able to influence the entire process to create the best product. If you are curious to discover Gong&#39;s wonderful and challenging world, what are you waiting for? Don’t delay - fill in your application details. Who knows, maybe there’s a Gongster in you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We encourage our employees to express their personality and identity (whether gender, ethnic, religious, or sexual), and we ensure fairness and equal opportunities. We follow a hybrid working model that combines working from home, on the go, or at the office. This allows us: flexibility, autonomy, positive work relationships, and effective work habits. If these considerations are important to you when choosing a workplace, we&#39;d love to see you with us. To review Gong&#39;s privacy policy, visit&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.gong.io/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gong.io/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;www.gong.io/privacy-policy/&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp; for more details.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;#LI-OM4&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Gong harnesses the power of AI to transform how revenue teams win. The Gong Revenue AI Operating System unifies data, insights, and workflows into a single, trusted system that observes, guides, and acts alongside the world’s most successful revenue teams. Powered by the Gong Revenue Graph, AI-powered intelligence, specialized agents, and trusted applications, Gong helps more than 5,000 companies around the world deeply understand their teams and customers, automate critical sales workflows, and close more deals with less effort. For more information, visit www.gong.io.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Gong, you will join a company built on innovative products, ambitious goals, and passionate people. We are shaping the future of revenue intelligence and we want people who are excited to build what comes next. You will work with a team that dreams big, moves fast, and cares deeply about the craft and about each other. Here, transparency and trust are core to how we operate, and every person has the opportunity to make a visible impact. If you want to grow, stretch, and do work that truly matters, Gong is the place to do the best work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Gong’s Professional Services organisation is growing rapidly, creating demand for Consultants who can bring structure, credibility and domain expertise to complex revenue transformations. Within Professional Services, the Activation Services team leads the activation of every new Enterprise customer—and is looking for people who want to help shape this at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is suited to someone with practical go-to-market experience within a revenue organisation, who understands how revenue teams operate and is ready to apply that expertise in a structured, client-facing consulting role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Consultant, you will own the discovery, design, strategy, business and privacy workstreams within each Activation engagement. Working alongside Engagement Managers, Technical Architects and Program Architects, you will act as a trusted customer advisor, applying industry expertise and best practice across complex projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gong Professional Services is at the forefront of AI-powered consulting and customer delivery. You will use Gong, AI and automation in your daily work, continuously build your AI and product expertise, and contribute to reusable workflows, assets and methodologies. You will also share best practices and customer insights to strengthen the wider Professional Services organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity for an experienced consulting or project professional to lead high-value engagements while helping shape the future of Gong Professional Services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the discovery, design, strategy, and business and privacy workshops across customer activations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery workshops to surface business requirements, uncover revenue process pain, and define the configuration and adoption approach for each engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the trusted advisor to the customer, bringing industry knowledge, revenue domain expertise and best practice to every interaction — from executive sponsor to frontline manager to end-user.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate real-world forecasting, pipeline and sales engagement practices into well-designed platform solutions that reflect how each customer&#39;s revenue motion actually works.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver polished, enterprise-grade presentations and documentation — solution designs, process maps, strategic roadmaps and stakeholder communications — suitable for audiences up to and including senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map customer objectives to product use cases, demonstrating clear outcomes that meet Gong&#39;s methodology exit criteria at each stage of the activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the Engagement Manager, Technical Architects and Program Architects to ensure workstreams progress in lockstep, and engage Product, Support and Customer Success where cross-functional input is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consult on change management and adoption from the outset, equipping customers to sustain and build on their investment beyond the activation phase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage engagements to scope and timeline, proactively escalating risks or delays with the Engagement Manager on the project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to practice development — refining discovery frameworks, solution design templates and consultative playbooks that help Activation Services grow consistently and sustainably.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI-Forward Delivery &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Gong, AI and automation to improve project planning, delivery, documentation, reporting and stakeholder communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to standardise, automate and scale repeatable Professional Services activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI responsibly by validating outputs, protecting sensitive information and applying appropriate human oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply learnings from customer engagements to improve delivery methods, tools, assets and team practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share effective AI use cases and delivery practices to build capability across Professional Services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Qualifications&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience within a go to market organisation or consulting environment, with hands-on experience in areas such as forecasting, sales engagement platforms, pipeline management or revenue operations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent cross-functional communication skills, with a track record of working across technical, commercial and operational teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working in ambiguous, fast-moving environments where product lines, methodology and cross-functional support models are constantly evolving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple workstreams simultaneously, prioritise effectively and drive tasks through to completion without losing attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven understanding of core revenue generating activities, including forecasting, prospecting, pipeline management, and executing established sales methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience producing polished, enterprise-grade deliverables — presentations, process documentation, configuration guides and strategic roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of CRM systems such as Salesforce, HubSpot or Dynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel across EMEA (Less than 5% expected).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with sales engagement platforms such as Gong, Outreach, Salesloft or Apollo, and/or revenue forecasting tools such as Clari, Aviso or Salesforce Forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI workflow configuration including agent customisation and prompt engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a high-growth SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of common integrations, including CRM integrations, SSO and API or OAuth based connections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;PERKS &amp;amp; BENEFITS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer Gongsters a variety of private health insurance plans, designed to fit you and your family’s needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing Fund - flexible wellness stipend to support a healthy lifestyle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Health benefits with covered therapy and coaching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education &amp;amp; learning stipend for personal growth and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible vacation time to promote a healthy work-life blend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave to support you and your family.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-wide recharge days each quarter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We have noticed a rise in recruiting impersonations across the industry, where scammers attempt to access candidates&#39; personal and financial information through fake interviews and offers. All Gong recruiting email communications will always come from the @gong.io domain. Any outreach claiming to be from Gong via other sources should be ignored.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Gong believes in offering competitive compensation and benefits tailored to the local region. Gong is an equal-opportunity employer. We believe that diversity is integral to our success, and do not discriminate based on race, colour, religion, age, or any other basis protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To review Gong&#39;s privacy policy, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gong.io/gong-io-job-candidates-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.gong.io/gong-io-job-candidates-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt; for more details.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-OH1&amp;nbsp; #LI-Hybrid&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Gong harnesses the power of AI to transform how revenue teams win. The Gong Revenue AI Operating System unifies data, insights, and workflows into a single, trusted system that observes, guides, and acts alongside the world’s most successful revenue teams. Powered by the Gong Revenue Graph, AI-powered intelligence, specialized agents, and trusted applications, Gong helps more than 5,000 companies around the world deeply understand their teams and customers, automate critical sales workflows, and close more deals with less effort. For more information, visit www.gong.io.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Gong, you will join a company built on innovative products, ambitious goals, and passionate people. We are shaping the future of revenue intelligence and we want people who are excited to build what comes next. You will work with a team that dreams big, moves fast, and cares deeply about the craft and about each other. Here, transparency and trust are core to how we operate, and every person has the opportunity to make a visible impact. If you want to grow, stretch, and do work that truly matters, Gong is the place to do the best work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Gong is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, International &amp;amp; Growth Enablement &lt;/strong&gt;to help accelerate the performance of our go-to-market teams across EMEA and APAC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Gong continues to expand globally, we&#39;re looking for an enablement leader who can bridge global strategy with regional execution, ensuring our teams have the knowledge, skills, tools, and confidence to succeed in their markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a traditional training role. We&#39;re building the next generation of GTM Enablement, powered by AI, informed by real customer interactions, and measured by business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll play a critical role in bringing global enablement initiatives to life across our international growth markets, supporting new hire onboarding, driving adoption of strategic programs, and partnering with regional leaders to identify and address the performance gaps that matter most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll also have the opportunity to help shape how we use Gong&#39;s own AI-powered platform to transform enablement, moving beyond content and completion rates to continuous, evidence-based development and measurable improvements in seller performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who is energized by change, comfortable operating at speed, and excited to help build what enablement looks like next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Regional Enablement Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary enablement partner for GTM teams and leaders across EMEA and APAC, ensuring global initiatives translate into meaningful regional impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapt and localize global enablement programs to reflect regional market dynamics, customer needs, sales motions, and cultural differences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with regional sales, presales, and post-sales leadership to understand business priorities, identify performance gaps, and deliver targeted enablement interventions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regional insights and feedback to global enablement teams, influencing program design and ensuring international requirements are considered from the outset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance the consistency of a global enablement strategy with the flexibility required to accelerate performance in growth markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate New Hire Readiness &amp;amp; Productivity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead regional execution of global onboarding programs for new GTM hires across EMEA and APAC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with global onboarding teams and regional managers to deliver an effective, engaging, and role-specific onboarding experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support new hires through critical readiness milestones, including product knowledge, messaging, sales methodology, and role-specific proficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage Gong to assess new hire performance, identify coaching opportunities, and accelerate time to productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with frontline managers to reinforce learning and ensure new hires can demonstrate proficiency in real customer interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Activate Global GTM Programs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive regional execution and adoption of global initiatives, including product launches, messaging updates, sales methodologies, competitive positioning, and strategic GTM priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with global Product Enablement, Field Enablement, and other cross-functional teams to deliver consistent, high-impact programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate global initiatives into relevant, actionable experiences that resonate with regional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reinforce critical skills and behaviors through targeted practice, coaching, and ongoing performance support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure program effectiveness through demonstrated proficiency, behavior change, adoption, and business impact, not simply participation or completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the Next Generation of AI-Powered Enablement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the use of AI and Gong to make enablement more intelligent, personalized, scalable, and effective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Gong&#39;s conversation intelligence, AI capabilities, and performance insights to identify skill gaps, detect emerging needs, and recommend targeted interventions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and implement innovative approaches to enablement, including AI-powered coaching, roleplay, proficiency validation, and workflow automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the global enablement organization to pilot new AI-driven approaches and scale successful practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shift enablement from event-based training to continuous, evidence-based performance improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring curiosity, experimentation, and a builder&#39;s mindset to how we evolve our enablement operating model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in GTM Enablement, Sales Enablement, Revenue Enablement, or a related field, including experience supporting international or geographically distributed teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success executing enablement programs that improve GTM readiness, productivity, and business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting onboarding and ongoing development for sales and other customer-facing roles in a fast-paced B2B SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of modern GTM motions, sales methodologies, and the challenges of scaling teams across international markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for AI and a demonstrated willingness to experiment with emerging technologies to improve how teams learn, execute, and perform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Gong or similar revenue intelligence platforms to inform coaching, enablement, and performance improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong program management and execution skills, with the ability to manage multiple priorities and deliver results in a rapidly evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, facilitation, and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to build trusted partnerships across cultures, functions, and levels of leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data-driven mindset and the ability to connect enablement activities to observable behavior changes and measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, resourceful approach to problem-solving, with the ability to operate independently while collaborating closely with a global team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Successful&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll thrive in this role if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think globally, execute locally.&lt;/strong&gt; You understand how to maintain global consistency while making programs relevant and effective in regional markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Focus on performance, not participation.&lt;/strong&gt; You care more about whether sellers can execute effectively than whether they&#39;ve completed a course.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are AI-first in your thinking.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re already experimenting with AI and see opportunities to fundamentally improve how enablement operates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operate with speed and ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t wait for perfect conditions. You identify what matters, build solutions, and move.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build strong relationships.&lt;/strong&gt; You earn credibility with regional leaders by understanding their business and helping solve meaningful challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are a builder at heart.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re excited to challenge conventional enablement practices and help create something better.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We&#39;ll Measure Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role will be measured by the impact of enablement on regional GTM performance, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New hire productivity:&lt;/strong&gt; Improvements in onboarding readiness, time to proficiency, and time to productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global program adoption:&lt;/strong&gt; Effective regional activation of strategic GTM initiatives and demonstrated changes in seller behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seller proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Measurable improvements in critical GTM skills, validated through real customer interactions and performance data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional business alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong partnerships with regional leaders and enablement priorities that directly support growth objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-powered innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Meaningful adoption of AI-driven enablement practices that improve effectiveness, efficiency, and scale.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gong is redefining how revenue teams work, and our enablement organisation has the opportunity to lead that transformation from the inside.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In this role, you won&#39;t just help our international teams keep pace with the business. You&#39;ll help them accelerate it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll work directly with global enablement leadership, partner with teams across the business, and have the opportunity to experiment with some of the most advanced AI capabilities in revenue technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you&#39;re excited about building the future of enablement rather than maintaining the playbook of the past, we&#39;d love to meet you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Gong harnesses the power of AI to transform how revenue teams win. The Gong Revenue AI Operating System unifies data, insights, and workflows into a single, trusted system that observes, guides, and acts alongside the world’s most successful revenue teams. Powered by the Gong Revenue Graph, AI-powered intelligence, specialized agents, and trusted applications, Gong helps more than 5,000 companies around the world deeply understand their teams and customers, automate critical sales workflows, and close more deals with less effort. For more information, visit www.gong.io.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Gong, you will join a company built on innovative products, ambitious goals, and passionate people. We are shaping the future of revenue intelligence and we want people who are excited to build what comes next. You will work with a team that dreams big, moves fast, and cares deeply about the craft and about each other. Here, transparency and trust are core to how we operate, and every person has the opportunity to make a visible impact. If you want to grow, stretch, and do work that truly matters, Gong is the place to do the best work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Sales Engineer on the team, you’ll fill a key role in ensuring our Prospects and Customers have a high-quality experience. Sales Engineers at Gong are not your typical SEs who give demos day in and day out. &amp;nbsp;We are strategic resources deployed to work with Gong’s largest opportunities in EMEA and solve complex use cases when no one else can. &amp;nbsp;Think of us as superheroes called into action when needed!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h5 style=&quot;font-family: &#39;BN Axel Grotesk&#39;; line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0 0 24px 0;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside Sales and Customer Success as the ultimate product expert and account team technical advisor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thoroughly understand all aspects of the Gong platform in order to explain and demo the technology to all types of users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the trusted advisor to both prospects and customers to ensure they get the correct business outcome and value from our Gong technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist prospects and customers with Business Assessments (POCs, Pilots).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute the build and delivery of solution-based demos/solution architecture diagrams for customers that have highly complex use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Craft content to show customers how to leverage Gong for specific use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution complex business and technical requirements and explain them in simple terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with RFPs and questionnaires in the context of sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help eliminate bottlenecks by working cross-functionally (Sales, Customer Success, Support, Product Management, Engineering) in order to get deals across the line.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with and support Marketing on demand gen activities (webinars, conferences, events).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute reusable assets to the Sales Engineering team and the company at large.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product Marketing, Product Management, and Engineering to share voice of the customer feedback in order to influence our product roadmap and GTM strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5 style=&quot;font-family: &#39;BN Axel Grotesk&#39;; line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;QUALIFICATIONS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0 0 24px 0;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of customer facing experience in a sales engineering role (pre-sales) or a combination of sales engineering and other relevant work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for serving the customer, which has played out in customer-facing pre-sales/sales roles; ideally sales engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with sales technology (CRMs), cloud architecture, or telephony/web conferencing systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data flows, AI/ML concepts, analytics, APIs/webhooks, or JSON&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of security and privacy pertaining to SaaS systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business understanding of GTM sales teams and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal and teamwork skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for technology and problem solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to make the complex sound simple!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Gong believes in offering competitive compensation and benefits tailored to the local region. Gong is an equal-opportunity employer. We believe that diversity is integral to our success, and do not discriminate based on race, colour, religion, age, or any other basis protected by law.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;To review Gong&#39;s privacy policy, visit &lt;a class=&quot;CfNQGlhWUWJsYONVgpIxUnCheSFloSNXpQc &quot; href=&quot;https://www.gong.io/gong-io-job-candidates-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-test-app-aware-link=&quot;&quot;&gt;https://www.gong.io/gong-io-job-candidates-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt; for more details.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-SM3&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Gong harnesses the power of AI to transform how revenue teams win. The Gong Revenue AI Operating System unifies data, insights, and workflows into a single, trusted system that observes, guides, and acts alongside the world’s most successful revenue teams. Powered by the Gong Revenue Graph, AI-powered intelligence, specialized agents, and trusted applications, Gong helps more than 5,000 companies around the world deeply understand their teams and customers, automate critical sales workflows, and close more deals with less effort. For more information, visit www.gong.io.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Gong, you will join a company built on innovative products, ambitious goals, and passionate people. We are shaping the future of revenue intelligence and we want people who are excited to build what comes next. You will work with a team that dreams big, moves fast, and cares deeply about the craft and about each other. Here, transparency and trust are core to how we operate, and every person has the opportunity to make a visible impact. If you want to grow, stretch, and do work that truly matters, Gong is the place to do the best work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a high-impact &lt;strong&gt;Support CX Projects Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Support Organization. In this role, you will be a key architect of our &lt;strong&gt;AI-scaled customer journey &lt;/strong&gt;within Gong’s Support ecosystem. Your mission is to continuously evolve how our customers engage with our scaled support offerings through a program of continuous process improvements and leading cross-functional projects that drive new innovations that drive efficiencies in support experience.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will manage and evolve our AI chatbot agent to deliver always-on, resourceful customer service, bridging the gap between technical troubleshooting and customer delight. By driving a multifaceted program of best-in-class AI deflection, you will ensure every interaction strengthens the customer relationship while improving our operational performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;KEY RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. AI Chatbot Management &amp;amp; Continuous Improvements Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the lead product expert for our new, in-app AI Support chatbot, while assessing the fit of new, complimentary solutions for additional channels and being responsible for successful deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and evolve the Ai Support chat experience to deliver a seamless, always-on solution that works in unison with our human-led Helpdesk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our UX and Product Writing teams to ensure chat interactions are anchored in correct context, user-centered, streamlined, and performant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the technical design, scoping, and implementation of future AI support experience, ensuring compliance with data security guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Continuous AI Deflection &amp;amp; Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a program of ongoing QA and deflection improvements to increase the efficiency of our AI-led support model and to influence and support Gong Community (and other customer event) strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Customer Education and Product Writing teams to improve content searchability and self-serve material accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute tailored AI-first strategies to drive customer adoption of automated support features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently research improvement opportunities and conduct experiments and measurement of AI initiatives to ensure they meet evolving business objectives.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Support Model Transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bridge the transition to an increasingly AI-led model, where complex or high-touch queries are seamlessly routed to human agents for AI-enhanced support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Support Operations to integrate AI automation across our systems that streamline workflows and accelerate the speed at which we support customers with their requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with R&amp;amp;D and Engineering teams to provide detailed feedback on productization plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Strategy, Reporting &amp;amp; KPIs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain a comprehensive Support CX/AI roadmap aligned with Gong’s global strategic goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and regularly report up on key performance indicators (KPIs), such as bot automated resolution rates, deflection rates, escalated case rates and BSAT.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;EXPERIENCE &amp;amp; REQUIREMENTS&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 4+ years of professional experience, with at least 2+ years in a customer-facing or program management role within a SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Domain Expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven experience with AI Agents, Large Language Models (LLMs), or managing automated deflection programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Fluency: &lt;/strong&gt;Familiarity with the modern CX tech stack, specifically &lt;strong&gt;Gong&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Salesforce&lt;/strong&gt;, and AI tools like &lt;strong&gt;Zendesk&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Intercom&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Competencies &amp;amp; Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to turn raw data and bot performance metrics into actionable weekly improvement plans and business cases for ongoing development work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; A growth mindset that values experimentation and can navigate ambiguity and constant change in a fast-scaling company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Engagement &amp;amp; Strong Communication: &lt;/strong&gt;The ability to make complex AI topics simple to understand for stakeholders across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Obsession: &lt;/strong&gt;A deep passion for solving customer problems through innovative, tech-forward solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gong Cultural Fit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bias for Action:&lt;/strong&gt; Thriving in collaborative, cross-functional environments.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gong-ster Spirit: &lt;/strong&gt;Proactive, high-energy, and resilient when faced with ambiguity.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bias for Action:&lt;/strong&gt; Impatient for results and focused on delivering measurable success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;PERKS &amp;amp; BENEFITS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer Gongsters a variety of private health insurance plans, designed to fit you and your family’s needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing Fund - flexible wellness stipend to support a healthy lifestyle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Health benefits with covered therapy and coaching.&lt;/li&gt;
