&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_e8b36cc4544c3a29-144&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;16,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;16,4,0,0&quot;&gt;In-office culinary options to cater to your dietary preferences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
