&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional data engineering experience with progressive technical leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in languages, including scripting (e.g. Python, Scala, Java) and expert-level SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep hands-on experience designing AWS cloud data infrastructure and scalable ETL pipelines (using Spark, dbt, or AWS Glue).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert knowledge of data modeling (Dimensional Modeling, Lakehouse/Medallion architectures).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with distributed databases and query engines (such as Snowflake, Redshift, Athena, or Presto).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of peer mentoring and collaborating with cross-functional teams.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with containerization (Docker, Kubernetes) and CI/CD pipelines (Buildkite, ArgoCD).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with ingestion systems (Kafka, Debezium, Meltano) and modern data formats (Parquet, Iceberg, Hudi).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with relational/OLTP databases (PostgreSQL, MySQL) and OLAP databases (Clickhouse, Druid).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging Generative AI (LLMs, Langchain, Bedrock) to accelerate data delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
