&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of full cycle GTM/Sales recruiting experience in a high growth tech environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise and talent market intelligence across business teams (GTM and G&amp;amp;A functions).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative recruiting approach and capable of attracting and converting talent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of partnering with GTM leaders to meet and exceed hiring goals.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data and metrics driven, ability to use data to inform decisions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, conceptual, and problem-solving abilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for building and managing diverse pipelines.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aligned with Fin&#39;s values; growth mindset, highly collaborative, work with a sense of urgency and obsess about customer success.&lt;/li&gt;
