&lt;p&gt;Our Sales Development organization is at the heart of Fin’s growth, serving as both our revenue engine and our talent pipeline. We identify and engage new customers across every segment, from Small Business to Enterprise, throughout EMEA, guiding them through the early stages of the sales process. The team is also the foundation for future careers across our Go-to-Market organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Fin, we’re customer-obsessed. We help businesses deliver exceptional customer experiences by combining the best of human expertise and AI, and we bring that same mindset to how we sell: working hard, working smart, and using data and innovation to keep raising the bar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Sales Development Manager, you’ll shape the next generation of sales talent, influence how we scale across EMEA, and play a central role in building one of the industry’s leading AI-powered Sales Development organizations. If you love seeing people grow, and you’re excited by what AI makes possible in sales, this is a role where you’ll have real impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What will I be doing?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re hiring a Sales Development Manager, EMEA to develop our team of Inbound SDRs supporting the GTM Sales organization across the region. You’ll build, coach, and develop a high-performing team that turns inbound interest into qualified, high-quality pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are looking for a leader with proven sales experience and a strong curiosity for AI technologies, someone who can thrive in a complex and rapidly evolving environment. You will be responsible for hiring, onboarding, and coaching SDRs, establishing repeatable processes that generate high-quality pipeline and revenue, and fostering a collaborative and high-performance culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration will be at the heart of your success. You will work closely with sales executives, marketing, and operations to craft and execute tailored strategies that move the business forward. By taking a data-centric approach to decision-making, you will ensure accurate forecasting, effective team management, and a healthy pipeline that empowers our sales teams to succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
