&lt;li&gt;2+ years of B2B software closing experience with a consistent track record of achieving quota.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with inbound teams that engage prospects through a personalized, multi-channel, value-led approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills: you’re comfortable interpreting metrics and turning them into insight and action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong operational rigor around activity metrics, conversion rates, pipeline quality, and execution consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of navigating complex internal ecosystems and building strong cross-functional partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate market feedback and customer insights into input for the broader GTM organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, dynamic environment with flexibility and agility.&lt;/li&gt;
