&lt;p&gt;Ready to level up your career at the company leading workforce transformation in the agentic era? You&#39;re in the right place. Agentforce is the future of AI, and you are the future of Salesforce.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s the opportunity?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fin.ai is building the AI agent that resolves customer support conversations autonomously — and our partner ecosystem is central to how we scale adoption in the EMEA market. As a Principal Partner Manager for EMEA, you&#39;ll own our partner relationships across a defined set of priority markets, working closely with our direct sales team to drive revenue through systems integrators, value added resellers, and local implementation partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a builder role for someone who thrives in a dynamic, high-growth environment. You&#39;ll be the architect of Fin.ai&#39;s EMEA partner motion — standing up programs, forging relationships, and converting partner activity into measurable pipeline for AI-driven customer support deployments. You&#39;ll operate across multiple partner types simultaneously and serve as the connective tissue between our ecosystem and our sales team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate brings a hunter&#39;s instinct to partnerships: proactive, commercially sharp, and energised by the challenge of building something meaningful in a market with real momentum around AI adoption in customer service. You&#39;ll work cross-functionally with sales, marketing, and regional leadership — and you&#39;ll be a visible face of Fin.ai in the EMEA partner and CX community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What will I be doing?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of Fin&#39;s partner portfolio across a defined set of priority EMEA markets, spanning systems integrators, cloud resellers, and local consulting partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and run joint go-to-market motions with regional consulting firms and CX implementation partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect partner-sourced activity directly into the regional sales team&#39;s pipeline through account mapping, warm introductions, and active deal support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring together cloud reseller and consulting partners teams around shared enterprise opportunities, orchestrating joint plays where it makes sense&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build durable, senior-level relationships with partner leadership, positioning yourself as a de facto member of their go-to-market org&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the reporting on partner-influenced and partner-sourced pipeline, and represent program results to internal leadership and the broader EMEA team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jump in on partner-led implementations when needed to protect delivery quality and keep partners bought in&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vet inbound partnership requests and go hunting for new relationships that open doors for Fin in your markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Fin&#39;s global and EMEA teams to localize programs for your region and feed regional learnings back into the broader partner strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What skills do I need?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in partnerships, channel, or alliances roles within enterprise SaaS, cloud, or CX/customer support software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience managing cloud resell &amp;amp; consulting partnerships — you&#39;re not a one-partner-type operator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong pipeline-generation instincts — you think in terms of sourced and influenced revenue, not just relationship health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial fluency — you can draw a straight line from partner activity to closed revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural collaborator with direct sales teams — you know what makes a rep&#39;s life easier and you build for that&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Range across levels — equally credible in a room with a partner CRO and coordinating day-to-day logistics with a partner marketing manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating in fast-moving, high-growth environments where the playbook is still being written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the EMEA market landscape; open to regular travel across the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational rigor — you can run multiple live partner relationships in parallel without anything slipping, and you over-communicate rather than under&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine curiosity about AI and a willingness to use AI tools to work smarter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
