&lt;li&gt;Exceptional listening skills &amp;amp; the ability to take quick action on what you’ve learned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organization and time management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectual curiosity and problem solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and coachable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly motivated and self-driven&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Bonus skills &amp;amp; attributes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
