&lt;p&gt;Ready to level up your career at the company leading workforce transformation in the agentic era? You&#39;re in the right place. Agentforce is the future of AI, and you are the future of Salesforce.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s the opportunity?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Program Manager to join the Strategic Program Management team in Dublin. Our team helps drive Fin&#39;s most important company priorities, from company objectives to critical cross-functional projects and programs. We&#39;re looking for a versatile, hands-on operator who thrives on solving complex business problems. No two challenges will look quite the same. You&#39;ll need to get up to speed quickly, bring clarity to ambiguity, build strong partnerships across the business and take ownership of driving meaningful outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What will I be doing?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with company leadership to drive Fin&#39;s highest-priority initiatives, from company objectives to critical cross-functional projects and programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step into complex, ambiguous or fast-moving areas of the business, quickly understand the problem, identify what needs to happen and take ownership of moving things forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and define programs of work, establishing clear priorities, outcomes, ownership and plans for successful execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get into the details to understand business challenges, surface open questions, identify trade-offs and help drive informed decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with senior leaders and cross-functional teams, building trusted relationships, bringing a point of view and challenging assumptions where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish the right structures and ways of working to create clarity, accountability and momentum, without introducing unnecessary complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive execution end to end, proactively identifying and resolving risks, blockers and dependencies to keep work moving and deliver results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and business context to understand performance, inform recommendations and communicate progress, risks and decisions clearly to stakeholders and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve how Fin operates, introducing practical, scalable solutions that make teams more effective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Live our company values and be a role model for the people and teams you work with.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What skills do I need?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 7+ years of experience in program management, business operations or similar roles, with a track record of delivering complex, cross-functional projects and programs. Experience in B2B SaaS is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re a strong generalist who can quickly understand unfamiliar business problems, connect the dots across different functions and identify what needs to happen to move things forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent operational judgment and know how to balance strategic thinking with hands-on execution. You&#39;re equally comfortable defining an approach and rolling up your sleeves to deliver it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience working directly with senior leaders and executives, building credibility, influencing decisions and constructively challenging thinking where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You demonstrate a high degree of ownership and accountability, with the ability to independently drive multiple high-priority initiatives in an ambiguous, fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong business acumen and are comfortable using data to understand problems, evaluate trade-offs, identify opportunities and make informed recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re proactive, resourceful and solutions-oriented, with a track record of navigating complexity, unblocking teams and driving work through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re an excellent communicator who can bring clarity to complex topics, facilitate productive discussions and tailor your communication to different audiences, including executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
