&lt;p&gt;The PreSales mission is to sell better to reduce turn rate and to push for value-driven propositions that solve for customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Solutions Engineer, you will partner with the sales organisation seamlessly to drive the execution of prospective and expansive deals. You will utilise your technical knowledge to become a trusted partner with sales and services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will your day-to-day look like?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building and maintaining relationships with sales reps, partners, customers and other internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gaining knowledge of HubSpot products for better-proposed solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding customer challenges and how to deliver technical value to meet their business goals and objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participating and directing projects relevant to presales, sales, and the wider business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coaching and mentoring less experienced team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do you need to succeed in this role?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
