&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Presales, technical consultant/sales role or similar (3+ years)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spoken and written fluency in English and Polish is required; proficiency in an additional language, ideally Spanish or Arabic, is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with internal teams and stakeholders and dealing with external customers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are open to admitting mistakes and believe that actionable feedback is a great way to learn and grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy collaborating with different teams and are motivated to develop yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.hubspot.com/blog/tabid/6307/bid/34234/the-hubspot-culture-code-creating-a-company-we-love.aspx&quot;&gt;HEART&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
