&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Working as part of ESW’s FP&amp;amp;A and commercial finance team, you will take ownership of financial planning, performance analysis and commercially focused initiatives that support profitable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Partnering with stakeholders across Commercial, Client Success, Operations and Finance, you will connect financial results with underlying business drivers, challenge assumptions and turn complex data into clear recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;This role combines ownership of core FP&amp;amp;A deliverables with opportunities to support strategic planning and commercial decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Financial Performance and Commercial Insight&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Own monthly performance reporting and analysis for assigned business areas, delivering accurate results and clear, actionable commentary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Analyse revenue, gross profit and operating costs against budget, forecast and prior periods, explaining the impact of volume, pricing, mix and cost movements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Assess profitability across clients, markets and services, identifying margin improvement opportunities and investigating underperformance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Work with Financial Accounting and Finance Operations to validate results, resolve discrepancies and understand material adjustments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Investigate underlying performance drivers, challenge commercial assumptions and follow findings through to agreed actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budgeting, Forecasting and Strategic Planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Own assigned elements of the annual budget, rolling forecasts and long-range planning process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Build and maintain financial models linking operational and commercial drivers to financial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Partner with business stakeholders to develop and challenge assumptions, identify risks and opportunities, and improve forecast accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Contribute to the development and refinement of the five-year business plan and associated value creation initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Prepare scenario and sensitivity analysis to assess potential outcomes and inform strategic decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Partnering and Decision Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Build strong relationships across finance and non-finance functions, providing constructive challenge and commercially relevant advice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Provide financial insight into pricing proposals, contract renewals, new business opportunities and changes to service offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Support business cases and investment appraisal, assessing expected returns, key assumptions and commercial risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Track the financial impact of agreed initiatives against business case expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Support strategic projects and, where required, acquisition evaluation and integration activity through modelling and performance analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Management Reporting and Presentations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Prepare high-quality management information and presentations for the CFO, CEO and senior leadership team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Translate complex financial and operational analysis into concise conclusions and recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Support commercial and financial performance reviews, highlighting priorities, decisions required and progress against agreed actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data and Process Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Analyse large volumes of financial and operational data, identifying the information most relevant to business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Improve reporting, forecasting and modelling processes to reduce manual effort and strengthen accuracy and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Partner with BI and data teams to develop dashboards, resolve data-quality issues and improve access to reliable information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Maintain clear documentation of models, assumptions and reporting processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;You are a highly analytical and commercially minded finance professional who enjoys understanding how a business operates and using that knowledge to influence decisions. You are comfortable working through detailed analysis, taking ownership of deliverables and communicating with senior stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;You will bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;A professional accounting qualification such as ACA, ACCA or CIMA, or equivalent relevant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Relevant experience in FP&amp;amp;A, commercial finance, finance business partnering or strategic finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Strong budgeting, forecasting and planning experience, with the ability to manage deliverables independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Strong financial modelling and advanced Excel skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;A sound understanding of month-end reporting and commercial performance drivers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;The ability to analyse complex datasets, investigate discrepancies and identify what matters most to the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;The confidence to challenge assumptions constructively and influence decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Clear, concise communication and strong stakeholder management skills across finance and non-finance teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;The ability to manage competing priorities and deliver high-quality work in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Curiosity, attention to detail and a proactive approach to solving problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Experience in ecommerce, technology, payments, logistics or another transaction-driven international business not necessary but preferable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About ESW&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our purpose is simple: to create moments that matter between people and the brands they cherish. We enable brands to expand their global reach, facilitating simple and seamless ecommerce experiences for consumers worldwide. Through our integration solutions, we deliver a complete international checkout experience, including local duties, taxes, fulfilment, delivery management, and global returns and payment processing capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guided by our values—Own It, Champion Simplicity, Win as One, and Debate then Commit—we strive to foster innovation, accountability, and teamwork, creating solutions that inspire trust and drive impactful results.&lt;/p&gt;
