&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our purpose is clear: to create meaningful moments between people and the brands they love. We empower brands to expand their global reach to over 260 countries, ensuring simple and seamless e-commerce experiences for consumers worldwide. Through our comprehensive integration solutions, we provide a complete international checkout experience, covering local duties, taxes, fulfillment, delivery management, global returns, and payment processing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will join ESW Global Delivery Service team, responsible for client onboarding across the entire lifecycle, from pre-sales, to scoping, implementation and ongoing delivery. The candidate will engage with both the client and internal stakeholders through a consultative process to clearly define, configure and deliver client requirements within the expected timeframe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical &amp;amp; operations support to sales during the client pre-sales phase of the client engagement process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document client solution requirements with tooling provided concisely and accurately, to ensure product and client implementation teams have absolute clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with Product Owners, to complete high-level client requirements to input into product development requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide input to the client Implementation schedule, ensuring all requirements are delivered for the client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing management of client expectations against product and functionality release schedules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report on the progress and health of the assigned client projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the client relationship from the pre-sales phase through to project launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Around 6-10 years of professional experience, with at least 3-4 years of experience in a solution engineering role or applicable sales and technical client support role within an e-commerce or development environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of B2C e-commerce solutions, processes, and technology solutions, including web stores, payments, and distribution platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: Bachelor’s degree in Business/Technology/Engineering or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured approach to specifying, documentation, and planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of leading consultative workshops with Clients to determine the best fit solution for the client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle and set realistic expectations with client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About ESW&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our purpose is simple: to create moments that matter between people and the brands they cherish. We enable brands to expand their global reach, facilitating simple and seamless ecommerce experiences for consumers worldwide. Through our integration solutions, we deliver a complete international checkout experience, including local duties, taxes, fulfilment, delivery management, and global returns and payment processing capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guided by our values—Own It, Champion Simplicity, Win as One, and Debate then Commit—we strive to foster innovation, accountability, and teamwork, creating solutions that inspire trust and drive impactful results.&lt;/p&gt;
