&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 5 years of experience in Treasury Capital management, within the banking sector, a consultancy, or regulatory body.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have detailed knowledge/experience of the European regulatory requirements, and the ability to interpret what that means for the relatively unique circumstances of our bank.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
