&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐ About the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a unique opportunity to shape Monzo’s international expansion strategy and play a key role in launching borrowing the next generation of markets. Sitting at the intersection of borrowing, operations, and execution, you’ll help identify where Monzo expands next and define how we successfully enter and scale credit in new geographies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Borrowing Strategy &amp;amp; Operations Manager, you’ll lead high-impact work across market assessment, customer and competitive insights, local borrowing strategy, regulatory setup, and launch execution. You’ll work closely with senior stakeholders across Borrowing, Engineering, Finance, Compliance, Marketing, Legal and Risk&amp;nbsp; to solve complex problems and build scalable market-entry playbooks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone with strong credit expertise, structured problem-solving skills and a bias for execution - someone excited by the challenge of building new markets from the ground up in a fast-moving, highly regulated environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑You’ll play a key role by…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Setting the vision for borrowing local features, understanding how it connects to Monzo’s expansion goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building the local borrowing proposition with world-class customer experiences in mind, understanding the full credit lifecycle of a customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defining, prioritising, and communicating short, mid, and long-term project goals for the product and market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with the borrowing collective and with marketing to create a high-conversion funnel and offering acceptance rate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring high customer satisfaction related to understanding and experience within the borrowing products segment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establishing reliable and reputable third-party partnerships and regulators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring zero tolerance of any compliance issue or breach of regulatory requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building products and/or features in retail or business borrowing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broad knowledge of risk management principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience from a top-tier management consultancy, investment firm, strategy team, and/or a high-growth international fintech or technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve worked on launching or scaling credit products and operations within European markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong knowledge of credit products, local banking infrastructure, and financial operations in EU&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re highly analytical and data-driven, with experience using data to define opportunities, prioritise initiatives, measure impact, and support decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re able to break down complex, ambiguous problems into clear frameworks and actionable plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re intellectually curious, commercially minded, and motivated by the opportunity to build and scale new markets from the ground up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re an excellent communicator and storyteller, able to influence and align stakeholders around a common vision&lt;/li&gt;
