&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Datadog is seeking a highly motivated, results oriented Director to join our high-growth organization and cutting-edge team. Our Technical Solutions team shares technical and product expertise with customers through ongoing guidance, presentations, technical evaluations, and demos. Premier Support Engineers (PSEs) support Datadog&#39;s Premier Customers with any technical questions or issues related to Datadog, engaging via asynchronous technical support channels as well as relationship-building cadence calls, technical troubleshooting calls, business reviews, conferences, and projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;This is a senior leadership role at the intersection of customer experience, technical support, people leadership, and business strategy. You will establish the regional vision, build leadership depth, strengthen operational rigor, and ensure Premier Support continues to scale without compromising technical quality or customer trust. You will also serve as an executive sponsor for strategic customers and a senior partner to Sales, Customer Success, Technical Account Management, Product, Engineering, and Global Support leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Own the vision, strategy, and operating plan for Premier Support Engineering across EMEA, translating global priorities into regional objectives, organizational plans, and measurable outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a team of Premier Support Engineering managers and senior individual contributors, building a strong leadership bench and an organization that operates with clarity and autonomy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Own regional KPIs (CSAT, time to resolution, responsiveness, customer outcomes) and the regional performance and culture. Advise managers on performance plans and reviews, and partner with the People team on talent and employee relations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Act as executive sponsor for key Premier accounts. Build trusted senior relationships, set expectations, and turn customer feedback into action.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Provide strategic guidance and oversight to Managers on regional projects and OKRs, ensuring their successful and timely completion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;GTM Partnership: Partner with Sales, Customer Success and TAM leadership on Premier onboarding, renewals and expansion, and represent Premier Support in executive business reviews.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Own regional hiring plans and quarterly hiring targets, and partner with Recruiting to attract, close and approve offers for top technical and customer-centric talent.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Ensure the successful onboarding, technical training, certification, and ongoing development of Premier Support Engineers across the region.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Build a proactive support model that uses customer context, support trends, product usage, upcoming launches, migrations, and business priorities to identify and mitigate risks before they escalate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Create scalable operating systems, playbooks, automation, and AI-enabled workflows that improve productivity, scalability, consistency, decision-making, and the customer experience across EMEA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Serve as the executive escalation point for critical Premier customer issues and incidents in the region, supporting your leaders through urgent customer situations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Connect product trends and roadmap signals to team readiness, and bring the Premier customer voice to Sales, Customer Success, Product and Engineering to improve supportability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Work from the Datadog office 3 - 5 days per week.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
