&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Accountable for enterprise customer outcomes such as CSAT, time to resolution, responsiveness and retention.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
