&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Curious and excited by technology, with some programming experience and a working knowledge of Linux&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
