&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Executive Recruiter to identify, engage, and hire exceptional leadership talent across Datadog. In this role, you will partner closely with senior executives to lead complex, high-impact Senior Director+ searches across our General &amp;amp; Administrative, Sales, and Technical Solutions organizations in North America and EMEA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will operate as a trusted advisor throughout the search process – developing search strategies, building market intelligence, assessing executive talent, and creating a highly personalized candidate experience. This role requires strong judgment, discretion, executive presence, and the ability to translate evolving business needs into a clear and actionable talent strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture—the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end executive searches for senior leadership roles, from intake and search strategy through assessment, offer, and close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with executives and senior leaders to define leadership profiles, calibrate requirements, and serve as a trusted advisor on talent strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop comprehensive market maps and talent landscapes, using research and market intelligence to identify high-caliber passive executive talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and cultivate relationships with senior executives through highly targeted outreach, thoughtful engagement, and long-term pipeline development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess executive candidates against business needs, leadership capabilities, organizational context, and long-term potential, providing clear recommendations to senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver a high-touch and confidential candidate experience while continuously evolving our executive search strategy, assessment practices, and approach to the market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of recruiting experience, including ownership of executive or senior leadership searches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in executive search methodologies, including talent mapping, market research, targeted sourcing, executive assessment, and closing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering directly with senior executives, with the credibility and executive presence to influence, challenge assumptions, and drive alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong at assessing senior talent beyond resume qualifications, with sound judgment around leadership capabilities, organizational fit, and career motivation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An exceptional communicator who can synthesize market intelligence, candidate insights, and search progress into clear recommendations for senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable navigating ambiguity, managing sensitive and confidential searches, and balancing multiple complex searches while maintaining a highly personalized candidate experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
