&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop in-depth knowledge of Datadog’s licensing and pricing models to provide deal structuring and quoting support to our global sales teams&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a creative problem solver who finds a way to meet customers’ needs while adhering to Datadog’s selling policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve customer satisfaction issues following execution of the deal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively negotiate deals directly with the customer as needed&lt;/li&gt;
