&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in 4+ years of Deal Desk experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident in deal structuring/quoting complex SaaS transactions for a fast-growing global company&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledgeable of revenue recognition principles&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable representing the company to customers in negotiations and resolving customer satisfaction issues&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong in your attention to detail and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work independently and multi-task in fast paced, high pressure environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven with strong quantitative skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical with the ability to approach a problem from multiple perspectives&lt;/li&gt;
