&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Sales Development Representative - English &amp;amp; EU Language&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Why We Have This Role&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The Sales Development Representative role is crucial to Qualtrics as it serves as the first point of contact for potential clients, helping to generate qualified leads that drive revenue growth. By engaging with decision-makers across various industries, SDRs gather insights that not only inform sales strategies but also enhance the overall understanding of market needs. This role helps create a robust sales pipeline, ensuring that Account Executives have quality prospects to engage with. Additionally, the SDR team plays a vital role in fostering collaboration with marketing, enhancing targeted campaigns that resonate with potential customers. Ultimately, SDRs contribute significantly to the company’s growth and success by laying the groundwork for meaningful customer relationships.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;How You’ll Find Success&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You identify key decision makers and/or key influencers within an organisation across many different departments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand the impact our products have on our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You articulate to prospects how our tools can help their organisations get to the next level with real-time data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work well with teammates, like to strategise, and plan out creative methods to generate more business opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You use rejection as fuel to motivate and push you to work harder and smarter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a self starter, competitive, and driven. You see the bigger picture. You don’t settle for mediocrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You don’t hit quota because that is what is expected of you, rather you blow past quota because it’s who you are&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Money, opportunity for growth, and promotion motivate you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are in sales because you want to drive your own destiny&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You view this opportunity as a career, not as a job&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;How You’ll Grow&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales Development is a rapidly growing division within the sales organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Purpose of the department:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate qualified pipeline that progresses through the sales funnel and produces new closed revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop new quota-carrying Account Executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Due to growth, we’re constantly looking for hungry and driven individuals who are passionate about a career in corporate sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Things You’ll Do&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You make 50+ calls and send 50+ personalised emails per day. In addition, you find and add 15+ new contacts to into your call cadence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work with Account Executives to discuss and strategise methods to penetrate targeted accounts with the goal of setting quality meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work closely with our Marketing team to execute on personalised account-based campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re the best with LinkedIn and Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You attend 1:1’s, team meetings, trainings, sales calls, discovery calls, demos, etc. to develop your skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You collaborate with your peers sharing standard methodologies, “oops moments,” and role playing to make sure you’re focused on continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You compete with yourself, your co-workers, and other teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re self disciplined, accountable, and reliable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;What We’re Looking For On Your Resume&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full fluency in English AND any of the following languages: German, French, Spanish, Italian or Dutch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Facing Experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales Experience Preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales Experience could include; sales internships, sales minor, sales program/ club, SDR experiences, inside sales, door-to-door sales, any cold calling experiences, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;What You Should Know About This Team&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Sales Development Representative team at Qualtrics is an integral part of our sales organisation, designed to cultivate talent and provide a clear career path for aspiring sales professionals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our unique Sales Development Program offers a structured approach to skill development, enabling SDRs to transition into Key Account Executives and become leaders in the Experience Management space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team members benefit from a supportive environment that emphasises collaboration and continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular training sessions, mentorship opportunities, and team meetings foster professional growth and skill enhancement, allowing SDRs to refine their sales techniques and industry knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team members will benefit from a hybrid work model that allows them to collaborate in the office for three days each week, while enjoying the flexibility to work from home for the remaining two days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
