&lt;p&gt;Toast builds the restaurant platform that helps restaurants adapt, take control, and get back to what they do best: building the businesses they love. Our Embedded Finance division develops financial products tailored specifically to restaurants, including bank accounts, debit and credit cards, and loans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an Android Software Engineer III to join our Banking team in Dublin, part of Toast’s Embedded Finance division. You’ll help build new financial capabilities in the ToastNow Android app, giving restaurant owners convenient access to the tools they need to manage their finances.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
