&lt;p&gt;Toast is driven by building a platform that helps our customers adapt, take control, and get back to what they do best: building the businesses they love. From independent operators to global enterprise chains with thousands of locations, Toast powers the full guest and operator experience - point of sale, kitchen display, online ordering, analytics, and beyond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;International expansion is a critical growth engine for Toast&#39;s future. Outside the US, we currently operate in Canada, UK, Ireland, and Australia and are actively growing our product platform in these markets. As we gain market share, we are increasing our up-market product investment into Mid-Market (MM). Our goal is to be able to win and retain larger and more complex restaurant and hospitality operators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
