&lt;li&gt;Design, build and maintain high performing, flexible, and scalable solutions that help restaurants deliver a best-in-class guest experience: define and execute the technical architecture while ensuring systems are scalable, reliable, and secure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product, Design and Engineering stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a strong hands-on presence, writing code, prototyping new patterns, and resolving complex technical bottlenecks under load.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Principal and Senior Principal Engineers across Toast to align on best practices and spec-driven development paradigms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide, mentor, and elevate engineers within the Team area, fostering a culture of technical excellence and continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship features end-to-end, from design through rollout, monitoring for success and iterating based on real-world use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an awesome teammate who&#39;s all in on collaboration and collective success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage cutting edge AI tools to enhance you and your team’s development workflow, improve velocity, and help pioneer new approaches to building - contributing to a culture of innovation and productivity across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor less experienced engineers and up-level the team through design reviews, constructive feedback, and agent-assisted engineering practices&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need To Thrive (Requirements)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
