&lt;li&gt;Balanced expertise: Ability to design high-level technical solutions on a whiteboard while remaining deeply connected to code-level execution and system performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communication: Ability to articulate complex technical ideas clearly to both technical peers and product leadership.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
