&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to internal developer platform (IDP) concepts or &quot;platform as a product&quot; thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AI agent orchestration, vector databases, model routing, or inference infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-cloud experience (AWS plus Azure or GCP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Service mesh technologies (Istio, Linkerd) or GitOps tooling (ArgoCD, Flux)&lt;/li&gt;
