&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;50:1-50:113;3102-3214&quot;&gt;Experience with IT projects beyond day-to-day support, such as migrations, tool rollouts, or process redesigns&lt;/li&gt;
