&lt;h3&gt;The opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own a book of existing MongoDB customers across the Middle East: AI-native companies, fast-growing mid-market businesses and lower-enterprise accounts. Your job is to grow what is already running on MongoDB and to open new doors around it. You will find new workloads that lift Atlas consumption, and you will win net-new business inside your book: new teams, business units, products and subsidiaries that don’t use MongoDB yet. You run each opportunity yourself, from first outreach to signed deal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These customers move fast, and many are bringing AI into production for the first time. Their buyers are developers, architects and engineering leaders, and they judge by what works. Your edge is knowing each customer’s product and roadmap well enough to spot the next workload before they ask, and bringing them what is new on the platform early. Revenue follows relevance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be based in our Dublin or Cork office on our hybrid working model and reports to the Regional Director, MEA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sales at MongoDB runs on customer obsession. Our sellers focus on the problems that matter most to the customers they serve, and on the people and businesses those customers serve in turn.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every deal has a name on it. The next one could be yours.&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mongodb.com/company/blog/culture/how-sales-career-at-mongodb-will-set-you-apart&quot;&gt; Hear what our sellers have to say&lt;/a&gt; about sales at MongoDB.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a named book of AI-native, mid-market and lower-enterprise accounts, with focus for Atlas consumption growth, retention and net-new revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build an account plan for each priority customer: which teams, applications and workloads run on MongoDB today, and where it could go next&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find and open new workloads, from modernising legacy databases to AI retrieval, vector search and agent applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hunt for new business inside your book: teams, business units and subsidiaries that do not yet run on MongoDB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships beyond your first contact, up to CTOs, VPs of Engineering, heads of data and AI, and the business owners behind them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support customers at every stage of their journey, so they adopt more, stay longer and get the most from the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work as one account team with Solutions Architects, Customer Success and Professional Services, bringing in the right expert at the right moment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a data-driven discovery process, structure and forecast consumption and commitment deals, and keep a disciplined pipeline in Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate your own pipeline through targeted outbound and by showing up in the local developer and startup community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring what you hear from customers back to Product and Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of full-cycle B2B software sales in a closing role, ideally selling database, cloud, infrastructure or developer-platform products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience carrying a quota and working within a commission structure, with a consistent record of meeting or beating it in a competitive market and examples of growing existing accounts through expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You don’t need to be an engineer, but you do need the curiosity to get technical quickly, so developers and architects take you seriously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running multi-stakeholder deals with a consultative style, so customers see you as an advisor rather than a vendor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pipeline and qualification discipline. Experience with MEDDPICC or Command of the Message helps, and we will train you in both&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication: you present with confidence and build relationships from individual contributors to C-level executives in English and native-level Arabic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High EQ, coachability, intellectual curiosity, drive and a team-first mindset, plus a degree or equivalent work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Things we love&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time inside a startup or scale-up, or a history of selling to AI-native, mid-market and lower-enterprise companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with consumption-based models: you understand how usage, commitments and growth curves work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with LLMs, vector search or retrieval, even from side projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A habit of describing your wins by what the customer built, not only by the size of the deal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with databases, developer personas and open-source technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily use of sales tools such as Salesforce, Outreach, Tableau and AI assistants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why join MongoDB&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your next step is clear. Our BDR to CRO program sets out the standards of excellence expected at every level, so you know exactly what it takes to be promoted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demand is moving your way. AI workloads are pulling new customers to the platform, we are launching new products, and revenue is growing around 30%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry-leading onboarding. An in-person Sales Bootcamp, sales training in MEDDPICC and Command of the Message, and cross-departmental mentor and buddy programmes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A culture that looks after you. Employee affinity groups, fertility assistance and a generous parental leave policy, so you can support your professional and personal journey&lt;/li&gt;
