&lt;p&gt;If you are thoughtful, excellent at articulating a company story, creative in your approach, and able to give candidates exceptional care while advising hiring leaders accurately and effectively across multiple simultaneous searches in a dynamic environment, this could be your dream contract. As a Sales Recruiter, you will build influential relationships with sales leaders and hiring managers and bring top-tier Enterprise Account Executives and direct sellers into MongoDB across EMEA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role can be based out of our Dublin office or remotely in the Ireland region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own full-cycle recruiting for Enterprise Account Executives and other direct sales roles across EMEA, from intake through offer close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with other senior recruiters, sales leaders and business stakeholders to understand territory, segment and quota needs, and recommend tailored recruiting strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop creative sourcing strategies, including social networking, direct outreach and referrals, to build pipelines that meet aggressive hiring goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Screen, interview and assess sales candidates, evaluating track record against quota, deal size, sales cycle and enterprise selling experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise hiring managers on market conditions, compensation expectations and competitive offers to drive timely, quality hiring decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage candidates from first outreach through offer negotiation and close, ensuring an exceptional candidate experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work effectively with recruiting coordinators, HR and business partners to keep the selection process efficient and fair&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate pipeline data and provide regular status updates on searches in our applicant tracking system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of recruiting experience in an agency or corporate environment, ideally at a software company or top-tier search firm, with a proven record of sourcing and closing enterprise sales talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience hiring Enterprise Account Executives and other quota-carrying direct sellers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success running multiple searches at once and hitting aggressive hiring targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven record of employing creative sourcing strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consulting and influencing skills, with confidence advising senior sales leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced, team-oriented environment while wearing many hats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree and/or equivalent professional work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience recruiting for database, cloud, data infrastructure or developer-focused software companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with enterprise ATS and sourcing tools (e.g., Greenhouse, LinkedIn Recruiter)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you are a passionate talent acquisition professional focused on delivering best-in-class recruiting results, you thrive in a fast-paced environment, you have a track record of acquiring the best sales talent, and you are comfortable in a highly visible role with a high level of accountability, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/li&gt;
