&lt;li&gt;Experience writing database queries and indexes - either document-based or relational&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing and reviewing technical specs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in A/B testing or product design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of designing, releasing, and monitoring highly complex features&lt;/li&gt;
