&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern software development processes and application architectures including (not an exhaustive list): agile development, domain driven design, microservice architectures, test-driven development, event-driven architectures, operational data layers, test automation, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with software development using Agentic AI solutions, such as Claude Code, Cursor, Github Copilot, Cognition Devin, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing with scalable and highly available distributed systems in the cloud and on-prem&lt;/li&gt;
