&lt;li&gt;Strategic Execution: Proven success in delivering complex cross-functional projects and the ability to write, defend, and execute on multi-year business cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education: B.Sc. in a technical discipline, with Computer Science preferred, or equivalent relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
