&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SolarWinds is looking for a motivated Inside Sales Representative to grow revenue across French-speaking markets in Africa. You will manage the full sales cycle for mid-market customers, working closely with local resellers and distributors, Sales Engineering, and internal teams. The role combines new-customer acquisition with expansion of existing accounts through cross-sell and upsell opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and win new mid-market customers while growing revenue and product adoption within existing accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with customers, resellers, and distribution partners across French-speaking markets in Africa.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage opportunities through the full sales cycle, from prospecting and discovery to solution presentation, proof of concept, commercial negotiation, and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Sales Engineering and channel partners to deliver relevant technical demonstrations and proof-of-concept engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present SolarWinds solutions and business value to customer stakeholders, including senior decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare quotations, support order intake and processing, and coordinate transactions with end customers, channel partners, and distributors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate opportunity and customer information in Salesforce and support regular pipeline and forecast reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal stakeholders to resolve customer and partner needs and ensure a smooth sales process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least two years of software sales experience, ideally in a partner- or reseller-led environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with resellers and distributors in African markets; experience in French-speaking markets is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong prospecting, relationship-building, negotiation, and consultative selling skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage both new-business acquisition and existing-account growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent French and good English communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident presenting solutions to technical and business audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An analytical, organized, self-directed approach, with resilience, flexibility, and a results-oriented mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in business or a technical field, or equivalent professional experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good working knowledge of MS Office and Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How you’ll succeed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will build a healthy pipeline, meet sales objectives, develop productive partner relationships, and consistently create value for both new and existing customers across the region.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;SolarWinds is an Equal Employment Opportunity Employer. SolarWinds will consider all qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, age, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity, marital status, disability, veteran status or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;
