&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SolarWinds is seeking a Manager, Enablement Programs to lead the operational team and repeatable processes that support Revenue Enablement. Working from priorities and program decisions set by the Director and Field Enablement roles, your team owns learning design and content production, communications, scheduling, and learning-tool administration and reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will manage a global team of five, including instructional designers, program managers, an enablement coordinator, and an LMS/CMS administrator who owns learning-tool administration and reporting. You will help the team execute approved priorities consistently and create repeatable ways to plan, coordinate, maintain, and evaluate its work, so that enablement requests are not handled as one-off projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a team responsible for instructional design, program management, training coordination, and go-to-market communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Operations &amp;amp; Intake&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the design, communication, scheduling, and maintenance work that supports onboarding, product launches, certifications, sales methodology, and ongoing field development, following priorities set by the Director and Field Enablement roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the enablement request intake workflow by gathering the business outcome, audience, urgency, scope, and impact. Prepare requests for review by the Director and Field Enablement roles, who determine priority, treatment, and content or training direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish reusable workflows and playbooks to move approved work from scoping through design support, review, communications, delivery logistics, follow-through, and closeout. Tailor the operational support to each program&#39;s scope and impact rather than creating a custom process for every request.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the follow-through plan defined by the program owner, such as an understanding check, practice, reinforcement, manager action, or measurement; ensure owners and logistics are clear.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning Tools &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the learning tools function through the CMS and LMS administrator on your team, including learning-tool administration and reporting. Ensure learner assignments and records are reliable, reporting is accurate, and insights are available to the Director and Field Enablement roles for program decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communications &amp;amp; Program Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate program schedules, facilitators, learner communications, and recurring enablement communications, including launch and training announcements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI, Automation &amp;amp; Operational Efficiency&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage SolarWinds&#39; AI technology stack to build and deploy AI agents and automated workflows that execute repeatable tasks, reduce manual effort, and increase team efficiency and output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities across instructional design, program management, communications, and learning operations to automate recurring work and create scalable processes. Examples include largely automated weekly sales newsletters, program reporting, content production, and learning administration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion responsible AI adoption by applying appropriate human review, quality controls, and oversight while continuously finding ways to increase team capacity without proportionally increasing resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Partnership &amp;amp; Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Field and Technical Enablement, Product, Product Marketing, Sales leaders, and subject matter experts to obtain the direction, source content, reviews, and approvals needed for accurate and timely program delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on measures agreed by program owners, such as participation, completion, learner feedback, readiness, behavior change, or business indicators where available. Use findings to improve program operations and share insights with decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to simplify, standardize, and improve recurring work and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing people, with clear communication and coaching skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in revenue enablement, sales learning, instructional design, learning and development, or program management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing cross-functional programs from planning through delivery and evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong prioritization, project management, and stakeholder partnership skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate approved program direction into clear work plans, learning assets, and communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience using AI tools to redesign workflows, automate processes, and improve operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build and implement AI-powered agents and automated workflows that execute repeatable tasks, connect information across systems, and produce reliable outputs with appropriate human oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical, data-informed approach to improving program operations and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience supporting a global business-to-business technology or software organization, and familiarity with learning platforms or digital learning tools, are an advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join SolarWinds&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the team that coordinates the design, communications, learning operations, and reporting behind global Revenue Enablement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build repeatable operating practices that help the organization deliver approved programs consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Revenue Enablement, Product, Marketing, and Sales leaders to support field readiness and major business initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the future of AI-enabled Revenue Enablement by building smarter, more automated ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
